  我们希望将速度 <math|<with|font-series|bold|u>> 场分解成<with|font-series|bold|平移>、<with|font-series|bold|变形>、<with|font-series|bold|涡旋>的三个场。变形场<with|font-shape|italic|无旋度>、涡旋场<with|font-shape|italic|无散度>。

  <section|数学前置>

  以下索引记法均采用爱因斯坦求和约定。

  <\definition>
    Kronecker delta

    <\equation*>
      \<delta\><rsup|i><rsub|j>=<choice|<tformat|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<table|<row|<\cell>
        1,
      </cell>|<\cell>
        i=j
      </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
        0,
      </cell>|<\cell>
        i\<neq\>j
      </cell>>>>>
    </equation*>
  </definition>

  <\definition>
    Levi-Civita symbol

    <\equation*>
      \<epsilon\><rsub|i j k>=<choice|<tformat|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<table|<row|<\cell>
        1,
      </cell>|<\cell>
        <text|if even permutation>
      </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
        -1,
      </cell>|<\cell>
        <text|if odd permutation>
      </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
        0,
      </cell>|<\cell>
        <text|if <math|i=j > or <math|i=k > or <math|j=k>>
      </cell>>>>>
    </equation*>
  </definition>

  <\lemma>
    Levi-Civita symbol 的乘积：

    <\equation>
      \<epsilon\><rsub|i j k>\<epsilon\><rsup|m n k>=<around*|(|\<delta\><rsup|m><rsub|i>\<delta\><rsup|n><rsub|j>-\<delta\><rsup|n><rsub|i>\<delta\><rsup|m><rsub|j>|)><label|thm:01>
    </equation>
  </lemma>

  <\lemma>
    对于 <math|<with|font-series|bold|u>,<with|font-series|bold|v>\<in\>\<bbb-R\><rsup|3>>，有：

    <\equation>
      <around*|(|<with|font-series|bold|u>\<times\><with|font-series|bold|v>|)><rsup|i>=\<epsilon\><rsup|i><rsub|j k>u<rsup|j>v<rsup|k><label|thm:02>
    </equation>

    这是向量叉乘用 Levi-Civita symbol 展开，可用于很多计算。
  </lemma>

  <section|拆分速度场>

  考虑对 <math|<with|font-series|bold|u>> 一阶麦克劳林展开：

  <\equation*>
    u<rsup|i>\<approx\>u<rsup|i><around*|(|0|)>+<below|<above|<big|sum>|3>|j=1><frac|\<partial\>u<rsup|i>|\<partial\>x<rsup|j>>\<delta\>x<rsup|j>
  </equation*>

  这里的 <math|\<delta\>x<rsup|j>> 是微小位移矢量的第 <math|j> 个分量。

  不失一般性，考虑 <math|u<rsup|i><around*|(|0|)>=0> 时，

  <\equation*>
    u<rsup|i>=<frac|\<partial\>u<rsup|i>|\<partial\>x<rsup|j>>\<delta\>x<rsup|j>=<around*|(|\<partial\><rsub|j>u<rsup|i>|)>\<delta\>x<rsup|j>
  </equation*>

  不难发现，<math|\<partial\><rsub|j>u<rsup|i>> 可以写成一个矩阵：

  <\equation*>
    \<Tau\><rsub|i j>=\<Tau\><rsup|i><rsub|j>\<triangleq\>\<partial\><rsub|j>u<rsup|i>\<Longrightarrow\><with|color|dark magenta|\<Tau\>=\<nabla\><with|font-series|bold|u>>
  </equation*>

  <\equation*>
    \<Tau\>\<delta\>x=<matrix|<tformat|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<cwith|3|3|1|2|cell-hyphen|t>|<cwith|1|3|3|3|cell-hyphen|t>|<cwith|3|3|3|3|cell-hyphen|t>|<table|<row|<\cell>
      \<partial\><rsub|1>u<rsup|1>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      \<partial\><rsub|2>u<rsup|1>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      \<partial\><rsub|3>u<rsup|1>
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      \<partial\><rsub|1>u<rsup|2>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      \<partial\><rsub|2>u<rsup|2>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      \<partial\><rsub|3>u<rsup|2>
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      \<partial\><rsub|1>u<rsup|3>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      \<partial\><rsub|2>u<rsup|3>
    </cell>|<\cell>
      \<partial\><rsub|3>u<rsup|3>
    </cell>>>>><matrix|<tformat|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<table|<row|<\cell>
      \<delta\>x<rsup|1>
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      \<delta\>x<rsup|2>
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      \<delta\>x<rsup|3>
    </cell>>>>>=<matrix|<tformat|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<table|<row|<\cell>
      <frac|\<partial\>u<rsup|1>|\<partial\>x<rsup|1>>\<delta\>x<rsup|1>+<frac|\<partial\>u<rsup|1>|\<partial\>x<rsup|2>>\<delta\>x<rsup|2>
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      <frac|\<partial\>u<rsup|2>|\<partial\>x<rsup|1>>\<delta\>x<rsup|1>+<frac|\<partial\>u<rsup|2>|\<partial\>x<rsup|2>>\<delta\>x<rsup|2>
    </cell>>|<row|<\cell>
      <frac|\<partial\>u<rsup|3>|\<partial\>x<rsup|1>>\<delta\>x<rsup|1>+<frac|\<partial\>u<rsup|3>|\<partial\>x<rsup|2>>\<delta\>x<rsup|2>
    </cell>>>>>=<with|font-series|bold|u>
  </equation*>

  也即，

  <\equation*>
    u<rsup|i>=\<Tau\><rsub|i j>\<delta\>x<rsup|j>
  </equation*>

  对 <math|\<Tau\>> 做自对称和反对称的拆分：

  <\align>
    <tformat|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<table|<row|<cell|<with|font-series|bold|\<mathD\>>=>|<cell|<frac|1|2><around*|[|\<Tau\>+\<Tau\><rsup|\<top\>>|]>\<Longrightarrow\><with|font-series|bold|\<mathD\>>=<with|font-series|bold|\<mathD\>><rsup|\<top\>>>>|<row|<cell|<with|font-series|bold|\<b-up-W\>>=>|<cell|<frac|1|2><around*|[|\<Tau\>-\<Tau\><rsup|\<top\>>|]>\<Longrightarrow\><with|font-series|bold|\<b-up-W\>>=-<with|font-series|bold|\<b-up-W\>><rsup|\<top\>>>>>>
  </align>

  再考虑初始速度 <math|<with|font-series|bold|u<rsub|0>>=<with|font-series|bold|u><around*|(|0|)>>，得到：

  <\equation>
    <with|color|blue|<with|font-series|bold|u>=<with|font-series|bold|u<rsub|0>>+<with|font-series|bold|\<mathD\>>\<delta\>x+<with|font-series|bold|\<b-up-W\>>\<delta\>x><label|eq:u>
  </equation>

  这里 <math|<with|font-series|bold|\<mathD\>>> 称为应变率张量，<math|<with|font-series|bold|\<b-up-W\>>> 称为旋转张量。

  <subsection|应变率张量>

  <\theorem>
    对于二次型

    <\equation*>
      f<around*|(|x|)>=x<rsup|\<top\>>\<Alpha\>x
    </equation*>

    我们有

    <\equation*>
      \<nabla\>f=<around*|(|\<Alpha\>+\<Alpha\><rsup|\<top\>>|)>x
    </equation*>
  </theorem>

  <\proof>
    将二次型展开

    <\equation*>
      f<around*|(|x|)>=<below|<above|<big|sum>|n>|i=1><below|<above|<big|sum>|n>|j=1>a<rsub|i j>x<rsup|i>x<rsup|j>
    </equation*>

    <\equation*>
      <frac|\<partial\>f|\<partial\>x<rsup|k>>=<below|<above|<big|sum>|n>|j=1>a<rsub|k j>x<rsup|j>+<below|<above|<big|sum>|n>|i=1>a<rsub|i k>x<rsup|i>
    </equation*>

    将 <math|<below|<above|<big|sum>|n>|i=1>a<rsub|i k>x<rsup|i>> 写成 <math|<below|<above|<big|sum>|n>|j=1>a<rsub|j k>x<rsup|j>>，则

    <\equation*>
      <frac|\<partial\>f|\<partial\>x<rsup|k>>=<below|<above|<big|sum>|n>|j=1><around*|(|a<rsub|k j>+a<rsub|j k>|)>x<rsup|j>\<Longrightarrow\>\<partial\><rsub|k>f=<around*|(|a<rsub|k j>+a<rsub|j k>|)>x<rsup|j>
    </equation*>

    <math|k> 从 <math|1> 到 <math|n> 索引，故

    <\equation*>
      \<nabla\>f=<around*|(|\<Alpha\>+\<Alpha\><rsup|\<top\>>|)>x
    </equation*>
  </proof>

  令 <math|f=2\<phi\>,\<Alpha\>=<with|font-series|bold|\<mathD\>>>，由于其自对称，故应变的贡献：

  <\equation>
    <with|color|red|<with|font-series|bold|\<mathD\>>\<delta\>x=\<nabla\>\<phi\>><label|eq:d><space|3em>\<phi\>=<frac|1|2>\<delta\>x<rsup|\<top\>><with|font-series|bold|\<mathD\>>\<delta\>x
  </equation>

  由向量场的恒等式知：

  <\equation*>
    \<nabla\>\<times\><around*|(|\<nabla\>\<phi\>|)>=0
  </equation*>

  故 <math|<with|font-series|bold|\<mathD\>>> 是<with|font-shape|italic|无旋场>。

  <subsection|旋转张量>

  <\definition>
    <\equation*>
      w<rsup|j>=-<frac|1|2>\<epsilon\><rsup|j m n>\<b-up-W\><rsub|m n>
    </equation*>
  </definition>

  <\proposition>
    <\equation>
      <with|font-series|bold|\<b-up-W\>>\<delta\>x=<with|font-series|bold|w>*\<times\>\<delta\>x<label|eq:w1>
    </equation>

    按<smart-ref|thm:02>展开：

    <\equation*>
      \<b-up-W\><rsub|i j>\<delta\>x<rsup|j>=\<epsilon\><rsub|i j k>w<rsup|j>\<delta\>x<rsup|k>
    </equation*>
  </proposition>

  <\proof>
    根据 <math|\<epsilon\><rsub|i j k>> 的性质、<math|<with|font-series|bold|\<b-up-W\>>>的反对称性和<smart-ref|thm:01>：

    <\align>
      <tformat|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<table|<row|<cell|\<epsilon\><rsub|i j k>w<rsup|j>\<delta\>x<rsup|k>=>|<cell|-<frac|1|2>\<epsilon\><rsub|i j k>\<epsilon\><rsup|j m n >\<b-up-W\><rsub|m n>\<delta\>x<rsup|k>>>|<row|<cell|=>|<cell|<frac|1|2>\<epsilon\><rsub|i \ k j>\<epsilon\><rsup| m n j >\<b-up-W\><rsub|m n>\<delta\>x<rsup|k>>>|<row|<cell|=>|<cell|<frac|1|2><around*|(|\<delta\><rsup|m><rsub|i>\<delta\><rsup|n><rsub|k>-\<delta\><rsup|n><rsub|i>\<delta\><rsup|m><rsub|k>|)>\<b-up-W\><rsub|m n>\<delta\>x<rsup|k>>>|<row|<cell|=>|<cell|<frac|1|2><around*|(|\<b-up-W\><rsub|i k>-\<b-up-W\><rsub|k i>|)>\<delta\>x<rsup|k>>>|<row|<cell|=>|<cell|\<b-up-W\><rsub|i k>\<delta\>x<rsup|k>=\<b-up-W\><rsub|i j>\<delta\>x<rsup|j>>>>>
    </align>

    也即，

    <\equation*>
      <with|font-series|bold|\<b-up-W\>>\<delta\>x=<with|font-series|bold|w>*\<times\>\<delta\>x
    </equation*>
  </proof>

  <\proposition>
    <\equation>
      <with|font-series|bold|w>=<frac|1|2>\<nabla\>\<times\><with|font-series|bold|u><label|eq:w2>
    </equation>

    按<smart-ref|thm:02>展开：

    <\equation*>
      w<rsup|i>=<frac|1|2>\<epsilon\><rsup|i><rsub|j k>\<partial\><rsub|j>u<rsup|k>
    </equation*>
  </proposition>

  <\proof>
    根据 <math|\<epsilon\><rsub|i j k>> 的性质和 <math|<with|font-series|bold|\<b-up-W\>>> 的定义展开：

    <\align>
      <tformat|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<table|<row|<cell|w<rsup|i>=>|<cell|-<frac|1|2>\<epsilon\><rsup|i m n>\<b-up-W\><rsub|m n>>>|<row|<cell|=>|<cell|-<frac|1|2>\<epsilon\><rsup|i m n><frac|1|2><around*|(|\<Tau\><rsub|m n>-\<Tau\><rsub|n m>|)>>>|<row|<cell|=>|<cell|-<frac|1|4>\<epsilon\><rsup|i m n><around*|(|\<partial\><rsub|n>u<rsup|m>-\<partial\><rsub|m>u<rsup|n>|)>>>|<row|<cell|=>|<cell|-<frac|1|4>\<epsilon\><rsup|i m n>\<partial\><rsub|n>u<rsup|m>+<frac|1|4>\<epsilon\><rsup|i m n>\<partial\><rsub|m>u<rsup|n>>>|<row|<cell|=>|<cell|<frac|1|4>\<epsilon\><rsup|i m n>\<partial\><rsub|m>u<rsup|n>+<frac|1|4>\<epsilon\><rsup|i m n>\<partial\><rsub|m>u<rsup|n>>>|<row|<cell|=>|<cell|<frac|1|2>\<epsilon\><rsup|i m n>\<partial\><rsub|m>u<rsup|n>>>>>
    </align>

    也即，

    <\equation*>
      <with|font-series|bold|w>=<frac|1|2>\<nabla\>\<times\><with|font-series|bold|u>
    </equation*>
  </proof>

  合并<smart-ref|eq:w1>和<smart-ref|eq:w2>，旋转的贡献：

  <\equation*>
    \;
  </equation*>

  <\equation>
    <with|color|red|<with|font-series|bold|\<b-up-W\>>\<delta\>x=<frac|1|2><around*|(|\<nabla\>\<times\><with|font-series|bold|u>|)>\<times\>\<delta\>x><label|eq:w>
  </equation>

  由向量场的恒等式知：

  <\equation*>
    \<nabla\>\<cdot\><around*|(|\<nabla\>\<times\><with|font-series|bold|u>|)>=0
  </equation*>

  故 <math|<with|font-series|bold|\<b-up-W\>>> 是<with|font-shape|italic|无散场>。

  最后，合并<smart-ref|eq:d>和<smart-ref|eq:w>到<smart-ref|eq:u>，得到亥姆霍兹分解的完整形式：

  <\equation*>
    <frame|<with|font-series|bold|u>=<with|font-series|bold|u<rsub|0>>+\<nabla\>\<phi\>+<frac|1|2><around*|(|\<nabla\>\<times\><with|font-series|bold|u>|)>\<times\>\<delta\>x>
  </equation*>

  其中，<math|\<phi\>=<frac|1|2>\<delta\>x<rsup|\<top\>><with|font-series|bold|\<mathD\>>\<delta\>x>。
</body>

